 "destacados": {
  "titulo": "Third Quarter 2026 Financial Highlights",
  "texto": [
   "Net cash from operating activities and Free Cash Flow were $1.4 billion for the third quarter 2026.",
   "Basic and Diluted earnings per share (\"EPS\") were $4.31 and $4.30, respectively, for the third quarter 2026.",
   "During the third quarter 2026, we repurchased and withheld 4.1 million shares of our Class A common stock, for a total cost of $1.4 billion 1 . At the end of 3Q 2026, we had 331 million shares of our Class A and Class B common stock outstanding.",
   "Given continued confidence in the Company's future, our board of directors approved an increase to our share repurchase authorization of $3.2 billion, bringing our total current share repurchase authorization to $3.6 billion as of the end of October."
  ],
